# POLLY, Band's KNOB 4 (Muted) in a song: the section's mute, as the Song page's black keys write it, saved with the
# song. Stopped: the Song page's cursor's section; playing: the section playing (heard at once). The knob and the tag
# say which section. Outside a song: the song's mute, every section (as before). The Intro playing: by hand, until the
# first section.
wait 300
# ---- a song of two sections (P1, P2), the cursor on section 2, the song stopped in it (PLAY, PLAY)
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
expect rows 2
turn SELECT 1
turn K2 -1
expect song_intro 0
turn SELECT -1
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect mode 2
expect playing 0
expect cursor 1
turn K1 1
expect cursor 2
# ---- Band, D1: KNOB 4 mutes it in section 2 (the cursor's), not in section 1, not the song's
tap SEQ
expect page 6
turn ALGO -4
expect track 1
expect knob4_is_no 1
expect knob4name_is_Muted_in_2 1
wait 200
turn K4 1
expect row_mute2 1
expect row_mute1 0
expect song1_mute 0
expect trk1_mute 1
expect knob4_is_yes 1
expect msgtext_is_D1_MUTED_IN_SECTION_2 1
shot band_song_muted.png
wait 1500
shot band_song.png
# again: it plays in section 2
wait 200
turn K4 1
expect row_mute2 0
expect msgtext_is_D1_PLAYS_IN_SECTION_2 1
wait 200
turn K4 1
expect row_mute2 1
# the Song page's cursor on section 1: the knob shows section 1's (D1 plays there)
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect page 1
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 1
tap SEQ
expect trk1_mute 0
expect knob4_is_no 1
expect knob4name_is_Muted_in_1 1
# the cursor on the END row: no section ("-"), a turn says so
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 2
expect cursor 3
tap SEQ
expect knob4_is_- 1
wait 200
turn K4 1
expect msgtext_is_NO_SECTION_AT_THE_CURSOR 1
expect row_mute1 0
expect row_mute2 1
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 1
tap SEQ
# ---- playing: the section playing. Section 1 (no Intro): D1 muted in it, heard at once
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect row 1
expect mutes 0
wait 200
turn K4 1
wait 50
expect row_mute1 1
expect mutes 1
expect msgtext_is_D1_MUTED_IN_SECTION_1 1
expect knob4name_is_Muted_in_1 1
shot band_song_playing.png
# section 2 starts with its own (muted there too); C1 muted in section 2 while it plays
wait 9000
expect row 2
expect mutes 1
expect knob4name_is_Muted_in_2 1
turn ALGO 4
expect track 5
wait 200
turn K4 1
wait 50
expect row_mute2 17
expect mutes 17
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- saved with the song: a reboot keeps both sections' mutes
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect row_mute1 1
expect row_mute2 17
expect song1_mute 0
# ---- outside a song (Free): the song's mute, every section (as before)
tap SEQ
turn ALGO -4
expect track 1
expect mode 0
wait 200
turn K4 1
expect song1_mute 1
expect knob4name_is_Muted 1
expect row_mute1 1
expect row_mute2 17
